{"id":"n60316-3-9","stage":0,"title":"닦다 · 擦","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60316-3-9-1","ko":"누가 바닥에 물을 흘렸나 봐.","zh":"看来是有人把水洒在地板上了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물을","audio":"/audio/46ddd583ad8778f3f0de.mp3"}},{"text":"흘렸나","meaning":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，淌出来，撒出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"1","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘렸나","audio":"/audio/9f591b07dd8b59aa6dab.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"使水或小粒的东西散落或掉落到外面。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ccf2577d48e3366dcf5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60316-3-9-2","ko":"휴지로 닦아 놓아야겠다.","zh":"得用纸巾把水擦干净。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴지로","meaning":"卫生纸，手纸","explanation":"휴지：卫生纸，手纸；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"휴지","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44797","senseId":"2","lemma":"휴지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴지로","audio":"/audio/75706b1e80bb4aa97f28.mp3"}},{"text":"닦아","meaning":"擦，拭","explanation":"닦다：擦，拭；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"닦다","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60316","senseId":"3","lemma":"닦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닦아","audio":"/audio/3ff71fa0c7c5de7be766.mp3"}},{"text":"놓아야겠다.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓아야겠다","audio":"/audio/87195780331e790b1135.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d0ab2df41b75912","term":"휴지","zh":"卫生纸，手纸","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3","entryId":"44797","definition":"用来擦脏东西的薄纸。","pronunciation":["휴지"]},{"id":"ba0c254ce311d46f","term":"닦다","zh":"擦，拭","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3","entryId":"60316","definition":"除去水分。","pronunciation":["닥따"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/bbcff7bb2ff508f9d4c4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.66,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60316","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":24,"sequenceScore":1.0388,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是有人把水洒在地板上了。","得用纸巾把水擦干净。","书架整理完了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是有人把水洒在地板上了。","得用纸巾把水擦干净。","书架整理完了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
